===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|zweinzec}}, from {{inh|de|goh|zweinzug}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*twaintigaz}}, {{m|gem-pro|*twai tigiwiz}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|twintig}}, {{cog|fy|tweintich}}, {{cog|en|twenty}}, {{cog|da|tyve}}. The form {{m|de||zwanzig}} goes back to dialects that had early on lowered {{m+|gmh||-ei-}} to {{IPAchar|[aɪ̯]}} (especially [[Bavarian]]); elsewhere the contraction yielded {{m|de||zwenzig}}, which waned around 1700 along with the uncontracted {{m|de||zweinzig}}.

